Finding: this is a license limitation, not a permissions/consent gap — the error is distinct
from the AuditLog.Read.All consent-gap error seen first, and names the actual cause
directly. Entra Free (this tenant's tier) does not expose sign-in logs via Graph's
auditLogs/signIns endpoint. Standing constraint for any future exercise that wants to use
sign-in logs as evidence: this path is not available without an Entra ID P1/P2 upgrade.
